.TH DASHBOARD\-BACKEND 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 158367ea" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
dashboard\-backend \- Serve the Kingdom dashboard API and WebSocket feed.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dashboard\-backend
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serve the Kingdom dashboard API and WebSocket feed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-compliance\-evidence \fISTRING\fR
Evidence file from cmd/compliance\-evidence (default <compliance\-root>/var/compliance/evidence.json)
.TP
.B \-\-compliance\-root \fISTRING\fR
Directory holding compliance/catalog/ (empty: /api/v1/compliance/* answer 503)
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable debug logging
.TP
.B \-\-dev\-plaintext
compose before internal TLS only: login cookie without Secure, issuer over plain http (also AUTH_BFF_DEV_PLAINTEXT=true)
.TP
.B \-\-health\-interval \fIDURATION\fR
Health check interval (default 15s)
.TP
.B \-\-health\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
Health check timeout (default 5s)
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output logs in JSON format
.TP
.B \-\-listen \fISTRING\fR
HTTP listen address (default :20000)
.TP
.B \-\-max\-connections \fIN\fR
Maximum WebSocket connections (default 100)
.TP
.B \-\-scrape\-interval \fIDURATION\fR
Metrics scrape interval (default 15s)
.TP
.B \-\-scrape\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
Metrics scrape timeout (default 10s)
.TP
.B \-\-services\-file \fISTRING\fR
Path to services endpoint file (name=host:port per line)
.TP
.B \-\-viz\-dir \fISTRING\fR
Path to advanced visualizations directory (dashboard/), served under /viz/
.TP
.B \-\-vm\-url \fISTRING\fR
VictoriaMetrics base URL for direct metric push (e.g. http://localhost:8428)
.TP
.B \-\-wotan \fISTRING\fR
Wotan HTTP address (host:port); default WOTAN_ADDR, then localhost:18000
.TP
.B \-\-wotan\-grpc\-addr \fISTRING\fR
Wotan gRPC address for TopicStream (enables real eBPF events)
.TP
.B \-\-ws\-allowed\-origins \fISTRING\fR
Comma\-separated WebSocket allowed origins (empty=localhost only)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
dashboard\-backend
dashboard\-backend \-\-listen :20000 \-\-services\-file services.yaml
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
